  "primary_outputs": [
    "Candidate method and outputs for the source task: Estimate the original empirical IO function from optogenetic response changes and compare the source Ricciardi, threshold-linear, power-law, logistic and stretched-exponential function fits. Retain attenuation and cell variability as descriptive outcomes.",
    "Source-paper comparison for Original IO-function estimation/model-comparison criterion in Supplementary Figure S11; exact formula and aggregation unresolved.: Methods specify least-squares Ricciardi fitting and alternative function families, but the exact Supplementary Figure S11 comparison criterion, normalization and numerical result are not recovered. Reconstruction RMSE against local vectors is not that source criterion."
